## Kin Player
# This is a web application for streaming music

## Installation
1. Clone the repository:
  git clone https://github.com/codthathing/music-player.git
2. Navigate to the project directory:
  cd music-player
3. Install dependencies:
  npm install jsmediatags --force
4. Start the development server:
  npm run start

## Usage
After starting the server, open your browser and navigate to `http://localhost:3000`.

## Technologies Used
- React
- CSS

